# Top-level dependencies for MentorKit skills
# Edit THIS file for soft constraints. Regenerate requirements.lock after changes:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes -o requirements.lock
#
# Why two files:
#   - .in:  loose constraints (what we want)
#   - .lock: exact versions + SHA256 hashes (what we install)
# The lock file is the guarantee: same Python, same deps, same hashes across machines.

